  "body": "Not every home gives you options. This one does.\r\n\r\nSpread across three levels, 592M Whangaparaoa Road offers a flexible layout that's increasingly difficult to find in today's market.\r\n\r\nThe main living area features two bedrooms, one bathroom with a separate toilet, and comfortable everyday living, while the lower level provides additional space including a living area, study, bathroom and kitchenette/laundry setup. Whether you're accommodating extended family, creating a work-from-home environment, hosting guests or seeking supplementary income potential, the versatility on offer is a real standout.\r\n\r\nBeyond the home itself, the location is hard to beat. Stanmore Bay Beach is only moments away, offering an easy coastal lifestyle with swimming, walking tracks and waterfront recreation close at hand. Local schools, shops, cafes and amenities are also within easy reach.\r\n\r\nLooking ahead, proximity to Penlink will provide improved access to the North Shore and Auckland CBD, adding further appeal for commuters and future-minded buyers alike.\r\n\r\nFlexible, functional and full of potential, this is a property that adapts to changing needs while delivering the lifestyle that makes the Whangaparaoa Peninsula such a sought-after place to call home.\r\n\r\nIf you're looking for a property that offers more possibilities than the average home, this is one you won't want to miss.",
